  "shortDescription": [
    {
      "locale": "en-US",
      "value": "As Riya embarks on a new chapter with Jogi, she dreams of a fairy tale romance, but fate throws a wrench in her plans leaving her heartbroken and lost. As their worlds collide and their dreams crumble, Riya finds solace in a loyal friend who is both her rock and secret admirer. As Riya starts to heal, she\u0027s faced with an unexpected twist: an agonising decision that pits her heart against her mind."
    },
    {
